":30231792,"digest":"sha256:ea9f2d7432d90f20808c0ec062aae0449df7534a5bf5b0f841c038d3d933ca2b","download_count":827,"created_at":"2026-10-16T18:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T18:42:07Z"},{"id":648278112,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4mo_Bg","name":"DBX_0.6.46_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":184024240,"digest":"sha256:aa2e4b4eee447bbf956cec2ad6c89d76df9e0b5317047062869260d3e73899fa","download_count":24,"created_at":"2026-10-16T18:52:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T18:52:29Z"},{"id":648278107,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4mo_Bb","name":"DBX_0.6.46_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:62dff67ac8f71b46405e96a8ee5aa9dae38c0325d01455513efb358a74cd67b2","download_count":11,"created_at":"2026-10-16T18:52:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T18:52:23Z"},{"id":648352026,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4mpREa","name":"DBX_0.6.46_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":43976610,"digest":"sha256:fc4cf42d351e3f895e913f0273711eb4fc623f2caec27e25de83e388071ff199","download_count":52,"created_at":"2026-10-16T19:20:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T19:20:21Z"},{"id":648250127,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4mo4MP","name":"DBX_0.6.46_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":39174144,"digest":"sha256:95f7cde154dfa7a72ddb5455f3f23137af4dde3b7761275ec877313e8609aca8","download_count":35,"created_at":"2026-10-16T18:42:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T18:42:04Z"},{"id":648352215,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4mpRHX","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":43919851,"digest":"sha256:20c4ab39073ae4bc1d16d8f8a6d936a88af8bb17f49da975b4e289f2093ae119","download_count":54,"created_at":"2026-10-16T19:20:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T19:20:24Z"},{"id":648380378,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4mpX_a","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":17957,"digest":"sha256:6b38447cbe82e170511da1ca76f6caddf0a8a9aad33881856f72f429803eb308","download_count":6479,"created_at":"2026-10-16T19:30:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T19:30:51Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- 新增 GBase 8c 连接类型，通过 agent 路线连接南大通用 openGauss 内核 (contributed by @xiSage) (PR [#12456](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12456))\n- macOS 上可检测并一键授权 dbx-mcp 访问钥匙串，授权后会验证对后台启动持续生效，MCP 工具调用不再报 SECRET_KEY_UNAVAILABLE\n- 连接新增空闲自动断开设置，空闲超过设定秒数后自动断开并保留已打开的查询标签与结果 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#12152](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12152))\n- 手动事务的空闲回滚超时支持按连接配置（30–86400 秒，默认 300 秒）\n- 对象浏览器和数据库列表新增紧凑九宫格视图，列表模式支持配置显示字段 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#12415](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12415))\n- 结果网格支持复制列注释 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#12469](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12469))\n- RocketMQ 连接支持 Proxy gRPC 方式发送消息，Proxy-only 部署无需配置 NameServer (contributed by @admxj) (PR [#12430](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12430))\n- 数据网格新增布尔列文本显示设置，可切换 true/false 与 1/0 两种写法 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12288](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12288))\n- 可编辑网格在最后一行按 ↓ 直接新增行，Esc 撤销新增行 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#12425](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12425))\n- 代码片段支持按周期自动上传到 GitHub、Gitee 和 GitLab，默认每 30 分钟 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#12057](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12057))\n- AI 设置页新增 Magpie 配置导入入口 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#12173](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12173))\n- 计划备份新增永久保留选项 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12375](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12375))\n- MongoDB 集合新增清空集合操作，与删除集合一起收纳进危险操作菜单 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#12370](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12370))\n- MongoDB 连接表单识别 Atlas 集群主机名时提示一键切换 mongodb+srv:// URL (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#12398](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12398))\n- 单元格详情编辑器对超长单行值自动折行显示 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12409](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12409))\n- 对象浏览器搜索支持省略对象名称中的下划线 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11643](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11643))\n\n### 改进\n\n- GBase 8s 拆分为独立的数据库类型入口，不再混在 GBase 通用入口下，存量 8s 连接自动迁移\n- GBase 8c 连接内置厂商 JDBC 驱动，无需再手动准备驱动 jar\n- 连接对话框把 GBase 8c 归入 GBase 分组入口\n- MCP 授权界面从分步向导改为分区标签页\n- SQL 格式化默认采用 DBX 排版并对齐字段与别名，已保存的 Classic 选择保留 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#12066](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12066))\n- 多表 JOIN 结果的表头列注释立即显示不再等待索引判定，表头类型显示长度/精度（如 varchar(50)） (contributed by @Mo-Moore) (PR [#12423](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12423))\n- 插件市场详情弹窗内容可滚动，更新历史按版本折叠并可跳转 GitHub Release (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12401](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12401))\n- 单元格详情编辑器打开 JSON 值时自动格式化，无需先手动点击 Format JSON (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12433](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12433))\n- 选中列时把导出选中列的格式选项提前到导出菜单首组 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11778](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11778))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 界面缩放较高时设置页底部的恢复默认/关闭/应用按钮不再被挤出窗口不可点击 (contributed by @HmEJ) (PR [#12443](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12443))\n- 主窗口恢复时检测到低于最小尺寸的损坏记录自动回退默认大小，不再被残留的 0×0 记录卡成小窗\n- Redis 模糊搜索的 keyspace 感知扫描预算真正生效，大 keyspace 下不再只扫约 5 万键就停止 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12468](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12468))\n- Redis 编辑连接的显示数据库选择器为元数据探测增加超时，服务端不响应时不再无限等待导致弹窗卡死 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12435](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12435))\n- 跳转到越界页后加载全部并转到末行改为从第一行完整重载，不再静默丢失剩余行 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#12325](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12325))\n- 跳页状态下加载全部完成首段重载后继续读取剩余分块，不再停在首批上限 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12434](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12434))\n- 数据表格 ORDER BY 补全默认选中第一项，按 Enter 直接接受 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#12365](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12365))\n- 切换标签页返回后数据库浏览器保持滚动位置 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12436](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12436))\n- MySQL 文本类 BLOB 单元格复制为解码后的文本，与网格预览一致 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#12420](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12420))\n- PostgreSQL 无主键表通过 tableoid/ctid/xmin 物理行定位符编辑，所有列完全相同的重复行也能安全更新和删除 (contributed by @onenewcode) (PR [#12380](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12380))\n- GaussDB 全局索引的索引列不再显示 tableoid 等系统列 (contributed by @AndrewDi) (PR [#12403](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12403))\n- DuckDB 查询的计算列正确上报列类型，金额等数值列导出 xlsx 不再变成文本列 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12417](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12417))\n- Databend 表数据编辑保存改为无事务方式，不再报 Transactions are not supported (contributed by @hongshuo-wang) (PR [#12027](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12027))\n- 数据传输到 H2 目标时 DATETIME 列映射为 TIMESTAMP，建表不再报 Unknown data type (contributed by @Sowevo) (PR [#12431](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12431))\n- GBase 8s / Informix 通用 JDBC 连接点击数据库不再报 getSchemas 方法不支持 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12397](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12397))\n- OceanBase Oracle 模式执行匿名 PL/SQL 块后返回 DBMS_OUTPUT 输出 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#12439](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12439))\n- OceanBase Oracle 序列 NEXTVAL/CURRVAL 查询不再被包进 ROWNUM 包装导致 OBE-02287 (contributed by @jeff377) (PR [#12386](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12386))\n- OceanBase Oracle 模式约束编辑修复预检查询、CHECK 读回误报和 UNIQUE 不支持的 ENABLE VALIDATE 后缀 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#12385](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12385))\n- Oracle / OceanBase Oracle 过程体中 DECODE 等连续 CASE 表达式不再被误判截断 CREATE PROCEDURE (contributed by @Mo-Moore) (PR [#12400](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12400))\n- MongoDB 编辑器接受 mongosh 风格的 Int32、Long、Double、Decimal128 构造器 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#12394](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12394))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.46) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.46` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":20}
